Hint: Pointers must stay inside the current unsafe block. Copy the pointed-to value out instead.
# CASE R3 ptr_offset out of bounds
Runtime Error in /tmp/luna_test_case.lu at line 3:
  ptr_add() moved outside the allocation bounds

