Hint: That pointer is no longer valid. Prefer defer(ptr) so cleanup happens once at block exit.
# CASE R5 address_of a temporary
Runtime Error in /tmp/luna_test_case.lu at line 2:
  address_of() only works on named values

   2 |     let p = address_of(1 + 2)

Hint: address_of() needs a variable name such as address_of(x), not a temporary expression.
# CASE R5 address_of outside unsafe
Runtime Error in /tmp/luna_test_case.lu at line 1:
  address_of() may only be used inside unsafe blocks

